      <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);line-height:1.7;margin:0 auto 0;max-width:560px">Buying the right refrigerator solves only half the problem. It still has to fit the opening, clear the cabinets and walls, sit level, connect safely to an existing water supply where required, and have the old unit removed. HomeHeroes handles refrigerator installation in Charlotte and surrounding areas.</p>
